{"author":{"id":"973fc03426eba9a243913e0f6e6823e102397744f60a9ab11c882af948c310c4"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1779812232,"nonce":"xC+0tNsEBC8gEY4btJrL7hh5RBs=","message":"Implemented the first-pass UI cross-reference behavior on feature/ledger-migration-finalization.\\n\\nSupported forms:\\n- [issue:\u003cref\u003e] and [issue:\u003cproject\u003e/\u003cref\u003e]\\n- #\u003c7-16 hex\u003e for short issue hashes in the current project\\n- canonical iss_* ledger IDs\\n- [comment:\u003cproject\u003e/\u003cissue\u003e#\u003ccomment\u003e], [comment:\u003cissue\u003e#\u003ccomment\u003e], and [comment:#\u003ccomment\u003e]\\n\\nThe renderer skips existing links, code spans, and code blocks so unrelated hashes inside code are not rewritten. Comment cards expose stable comment element IDs, and the Issues view consumes the comment query param to scroll to the referenced comment after loading the target issue.\\n\\nTests: npm test -- test/ui.test.ts, plus full npm test during the migration-finalization branch verification.","files":null}]}